Design: detect stale ohya mcp processes from observe snapshots (PID, build_revision, sampled_wall_ms) instead of /proc/<pid>/exe, so the check works on macOS. Only live instances with a snapshot younger than SnapshotStaleAge count, to avoid PID reuse. Severity warn, not error: the service works, the session only runs old code. Setup does not report it yet: a non-complete setup result exits nonzero.
